格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Systematically clarify intent, challenge assumptions, resolve contradictions, and align goals, constraints, risks, and success criteria.","id":"gh:1327854826","install_available":false,"language":null,"name":"clarify-intent-and-establish-shared-understanding","slug":"Inference1/clarify-intent-and-establish-shared-understanding","topics":["agent-skill","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Systematically clarify intent, challenge assumptions, resolve contradictions, and align goals, const"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"raints, risks, and success criteria."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# clarify-intent-and-establish-shared-understanding"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"## 🚀 Quick Start"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"### Option 1: Ask Your Agent to Install It"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Simply tell your agent:"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"`Install the clarify-intent-and-establish-shared-understanding skill from https://github.com/Inferen"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ce1/clarify-intent-and-establish-shared-understanding for this project.`"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### Option 2: Install with `npx skills`"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The easiest command-line method is the `skills` CLI."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**Interactive installation**"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The installer will let you choose the target Agent and installation scope."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Install for a specific Agent**"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Replace `claude-code` with the desired Agent identifier, such as `codex`, `cursor`, `github-copilot`"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"de` with the desired Agent identifier, such as `codex`, `cursor`, `github-copilot`, or `gemini-cli`."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Install globally for that Agent:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**Install for all supported Agents**"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Project-level:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Global:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Project-level installation is the default; `-g` / `--global` makes the Skill available across projec"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ject-level installation is the default; `-g` / `--global` makes the Skill available across projects."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Option 3: Install Manually"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Download the repository as a ZIP from GitHub, or clone it:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Then copy the repository folder into your Agent's **project-level** or **global** skills directory. "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"Keep `SKILL.md` inside the Skill folder:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"For example, with Claude Code:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Common Agent locations include:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Agent          | Project-level     | Global               |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| Claude Code    | `.claude/skills/` | `~/.claude/skills/`  |\n| Codex          | `.agents/skills/` |"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" `~/.codex/skills/`   |\n| Cursor         | `.agents/skills/` | `~/.cursor/skills/`  |\n| GitHub Copil"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"ot | `.agents/skills/` | `~/.copilot/skills/` |\n| Gemini CLI     | `.agents/skills/` | `~/.gemini/sk"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"ents/skills/` | `~/.copilot/skills/` |\n| Gemini CLI     | `.agents/skills/` | `~/.gemini/skills/`  |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"For other Agents, use their documented skills directory or let `npx skills add` select the correct l"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ocation automatically."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The `skills` CLI currently documents project scope as the default, `-g/--global` for user-wide insta"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"llation, `-a/--agent` for targeting specific agents, and `--all` for installing all discovered skill"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"s to all supported agents. ([GitHub][2])"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## ✨ Introduction"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"AI agents often face an \"Autonomy–Interaction Dilemma\": when users provide ambiguous prompts or inst"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"ructions, highly autonomous systems may proceed for extended periods without sufficient interaction."},{"id":"p36s3","text":" As a result, they may produce Deep Research reports that diverge substantially from user expectatio"},{"id":"p36s4","text":"ns or make inappropriate modifications to code. Such outcomes not only compromise task quality but a"},{"id":"p36s5","text":"lso result in unnecessary expenditures of computational resources and time. Therefore, achieving an "},{"id":"p36s6","text":"appropriate balance between autonomous execution and timely user interaction is critical to improvin"},{"id":"p36s7","text":"g agent performance."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## ✅️ What Does This SKILL Do? When Is It Triggered?"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"The SKILL `clarify-intent-and-establish-shared-understanding` systematically examines and refines a "},{"id":"p39s2","text":"user's plan, decision, goal, strategy, proposal, or idea before consequential actions are taken. Its"},{"id":"p39s3","text":" purpose is to establish a precise and shared understanding of the user's intent, objectives, constr"},{"id":"p39s4","text":"aints, priorities, assumptions, dependencies, risks, trade-offs, and measurable criteria for success"},{"id":"p39s5","text":". It achieves this through adaptive and progressively deeper questioning, posing exactly one high-le"},{"id":"p39s6","text":"verage, decision-focused question at a time. Throughout this process, it distinguishes among facts, "},{"id":"p39s7","text":"assumptions, hypotheses, and unknowns; identifies contradictions and information gaps; directly veri"},{"id":"p39s8","text":"fies available facts; and periodically synthesizes the emerging shared understanding."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"The SKILL is triggered when the user explicitly requests rigorous scrutiny, such as **grilling, chal"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"lenging, pressure-testing, cross-examination, red-team review, pre-mortem analysis, or a decision au"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"dit**. The process continues until the reasoning is coherent, grounded in available evidence, respon"},{"id":"p40s4","text":"sive to relevant constraints, informed by an explicit assessment of risks, actionable, and confirmed"},{"id":"p40s5","text":"ant constraints, informed by an explicit assessment of risks, actionable, and confirmed by the user."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## 💓 Why this Skill?"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"This skill is especially valuable when the quality of an outcome depends on accurately defining the "},{"id":"p42s2","text":"problem before taking action. It is intended for decisions, plans, strategies, proposals, and goal-s"},{"id":"p42s3","text":"etting processes in which ambiguous objectives, implicit assumptions, conflicting constraints, insuf"},{"id":"p42s4","text":"ficient evidence, overlooked dependencies, or inadequately assessed risks may result in costly error"},{"id":"p42s5","text":"cient evidence, overlooked dependencies, or inadequately assessed risks may result in costly errors."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"Rather than accepting the user's initial framing uncritically, the skill systematically evaluates it"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"s validity through focused and adaptive questioning. The process develops a shared understanding of "},{"id":"p43s3","text":"the underlying objectives, priorities, constraints, assumptions, trade-offs, risks, and measurable c"},{"id":"p43s4","text":"riteria for success. It also distinguishes established facts from hypotheses and unresolved uncertai"},{"id":"p43s5","text":"nties, identifies contradictions, and verifies relevant information directly when possible. By preve"},{"id":"p43s6","text":"nting premature action and identifying weaknesses at an early stage, the process transforms ambiguou"},{"id":"p43s7","text":"s or insufficiently supported reasoning into a coherent, evidence-informed, constraint-sensitive, an"},{"id":"p43s8","text":"d actionable framework for goal forge."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
